{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>לזרא</b> with an א — they found in it every kind of taste except one, and that is the taste of the Leviathan (for עין לא ראתה). לזרא in gematria: לחלי מעים."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {0 "The parenthetical quotes Isaiah 64:3, עין לא ראתה אלהים זולתך, applied here to the Leviathan's unique taste. The gematria equates לזרא (=100, as the plene spelling with alef) with לחלי מעים, 'to ailing of bowels,' presaging the plague that follows."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:54.042796079Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}